---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: home
pageType: home
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Los Angeles mail art, one postcard at a time"
  description: "An archive of {{ groups.stats.artworks }} ArtCards by {{ groups.stats.artists }} artists from across Los Angeles County (2009–2015), organized by ZIP code and neighborhood. Formerly LA-Artist.com."
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>ArtCard: Los Angeles, one postcard at a time</h1>
  <p>From 2009 to 2015, volunteers left blank, pre-addressed postcards in coffee shops, galleries, libraries, community centers and schools across Los Angeles County. People turned each one into a free 4″ × 6″ canvas, wrote their name and ZIP code on the front, and mailed it back.</p>
  <p class="stats">{{ groups.stats.artworks }} ArtCards · {{ groups.stats.artists }} artists · {{ groups.stats.zips }} ZIP codes · {{ groups.stats.neighborhoods }} neighborhoods</p>
  <p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Explore the map</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/zips/' | url }}">Browse by ZIP</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/artists/' | url }}">Artists A–Z</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/books/' | url }}">Books</a> <a class="btn ig" href="https://www.instagram.com/artcard.la/"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>Follow @artcard.la on Instagram</a></p>
</section>

<section class="mapwrap">
  <h2>Where the cards came from</h2>
  <div id="map" class="map" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}" role="region" aria-label="Map of LA County ZIP codes shaded by number of ArtCards"></div>
  <p class="note">Darker ZIP codes sent in more cards. Tap a ZIP to see its cards. <a href="{{ '/map/' | url }}">Full-screen map</a></p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>From the collection <button class="shuffle" id="shuffle" type="button">Shuffle</button></h2>
  <div id="wall" data-prefix="{{ pathPrefix }}">
  {% set items = groups.art | take(30) %}{% include "grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css' | url }}">
<script src="{{ '/assets/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/map.js' | url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/wall.js' | url }}"></script>
